window.docContents[85].resolve({"/Mathlib-upstream-boundary/#Quadratic-Number-Fields-Blueprint--Mathlib-upstream-boundary":{"contents":"\n\nGeneral-purpose facts that are missing from mathlib are developed locally under\nQuadraticNumberFields/Mathlib/, mirroring likely upstream paths and feeding\nthe upstream-candidate boundary.\n\nNumberField.discr_eq_of_algEquiv is a local\nupstream candidate for transporting absolute discriminants across algebra\nequivalences, used by\nthe discriminant-formula transport.\n\nAlgEquiv.ringOfIntegers transports rings of integers across algebra\nequivalences and belongs to the general transport\nlayer, underlying\nthe ring-of-integers transport.\n\nThe Dedekind-domain transport lemma is another\nshim candidate for eventual upstream movement\nonce its final mathlib home is chosen; it backs\nthe project Dedekind-domain statement.\n\nThe project-owned Zsqrtd model stays independent from\nmathlib's Zsqrtd except for the dedicated bridge file. This is project\narchitecture, not an upstream API.\n\nThe ring-of-integers classification is currently\nproject-only: it is central to this repository but not presented as a finished\nmathlib theorem.\n\nThe intended lifecycle is: add a local shim, use\nit in the project, upstream it through a mathlib PR, then delete the local\nshim and migrate callers.\n\n","context":"Quadratic Number Fields Blueprint","header":"9. Mathlib upstream boundary","id":"/Mathlib-upstream-boundary/#Quadratic-Number-Fields-Blueprint--Mathlib-upstream-boundary"}});